      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INTENSE HEAT (1) is a two-year-old colt by Bling It On from Fiery Package on debut. Has the benefit of a good draw. Showed some ability when a minor placegetter in a recent trial. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to his career. BOY STUNNER (9) could only manage to finish fifth at his latest appearance over 2100m at Young, failing to live up to market expectations. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. Big chance if things go his way. Lennytheshark debutant JENNY THE SHARK (2) draws to advantage and has shown enough at the trials to make an immediate impact. JIVEANDWHISPER (6) must be included on the back of some solid recent form, most recently when fourth at Goulburn over 1710m.",
